  "changed_since_previous": "Diff provided; commits and functionality are unchanged.",
  "card": "Adds a rebroadcastwallettx RPC command and a GUI context menu item allowing users to manually rebroadcast an unconfirmed wallet transaction by txid. Previously, manual rebroadcast required fetching the raw transaction hex and submitting it via sendrawtransaction. The wallet validates eligibility by ensuring the transaction is not abandoned, coinbase, or confirmed before submitting it to the mempool and relaying it to all peers. The addition was motivated by broader transaction rebroadcasting discussions in issue 36403.",
